      "en": "The children of your chosen sister greet you. Amen.",
      "ko": "택하심을 입은 네 자매의 자녀가 네게 문안하느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "df81375909fcddb3ac733ffa3407d99a1c33ea999a177eeef904bdfe569409ee",
      "translation_text_hash": "8fa4f562bcc9bd037685d8ef2d9de5cdd5e5d8d6d7d239d46b3f032aff552f51",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
